{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47791","headline":"吟 二 · 芙蓉古丈夫　毛女","name":"吟 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁知古是与今非，闲蹑青霞与翠微。\n箫管秦楼应寂寂，彩云空惹薜萝衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"芙蓉古丈夫　毛女","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}